# DICOM File Loading using pydicom

This section demonstrates how to load and visualize a DICOM (Digital Imaging and Communications in Medicine) file using Python.

##  Overview

DICOM is a standard format used in medical imaging (CT scans, X-rays, MRI, etc.).  
In this example, a sample DICOM file is loaded using `pydicom`, and the image is displayed using `matplotlib`.

## Requirements

Install the required libraries:

```bash
pip install pydicom matplotlib